WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:03.898
Two React props put your state in charge of the animation.

2
00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:07.575
Keep whether it plays in React state.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.386
Pass it to play, and a button flips it.

4
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.682
For scrubbing, keep the progress in state too.

5
00:00:36.967 --> 00:00:40.415
Bind progress to a slider, and dragging scrubs it.

6
00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:07.039
Set both, and progress wins: controlled time beats play, and play beats autoplay.
